{"seq":3,"slug":"per-person-limit-rule","title":"每人限购规则与合并","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/identity-limit-binding/per-person-limit-rule","wordCount":1992,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"每人限购规则与合并\">每人限购规则与合并</h1><p>&quot;每人限购 2 件&quot;这句话在单渠道系统里是个简单约束，在真实的限量发售场景里却是一个难解的问题：用户可能在 App、小程序、线下门店、会员体系里各有一份记录，这些记录在业务库里是不同表的不同主键，但它们指向同一个人。如果限购规则只在一个渠道内执行，规则就会在渠道边界上被绕过——这不是漏洞，而是设计缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>&quot;每人限购 2 件&quot;在单渠道系统里是简单约束，在跨渠道场景里却需要一套<strong>中央配额账本</strong>：所有渠道的占用都按自然人主体记账，额度检查在一个事务内完成，而合并的处置强度随不可逆程度递减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限购的三个正交维度\">限购的三个正交维度</h2><h3 id=\"三个约束是递减的\">三个约束是递减的</h3><h3 id=\"跨渠道额度申请与合并流程\">跨渠道额度申请与合并流程</h3><p>三个渠道的额度申请最终都要落到同一个账本上，而合并的处置强度取决于它发生在流程的哪一段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[渠道账号行为&lt;br/&gt;App / 小程序 / 门店] --&gt; B[主体归一化&lt;br/&gt;关联图给出 subject_id]&#10;  B --&gt; C{配额账本&lt;br/&gt;按 subject + sku 记账}&#10;  C --&gt;|advisory lock 通过| D[写入 reserved/confirmed]&#10;  C --&gt;|超出 limit| E[拒绝并返回 used/limit]&#10;  D --&gt; F{合并发现时机}&#10;  F --&gt;|抽签前| G[合并为一份报名]&#10;  F --&gt;|开奖后核销前| H[保留一份&lt;br/&gt;其余释放到候补]&#10;  F --&gt;|核销后发货前| I[取消订单 + 退款]&#10;  F --&gt;|发货后| J[人工复核]\">graph TD\n  A[渠道账号行为&lt;br/&gt;App / 小程序 / 门店] --&gt; B[主体归一化&lt;br/&gt;关联图给出 subject_id]\n  B --&gt; C{配额账本&lt;br/&gt;按 subject + sku 记账}\n  C --&gt;|advisory lock 通过| D[写入 reserved/confirmed]\n  C --&gt;|超出 limit| E[拒绝并返回 used/limit]\n  D --&gt; F{合并发现时机}\n  F --&gt;|抽签前| G[合并为一份报名]\n  F --&gt;|开奖后核销前| H[保留一份&lt;br/&gt;其余释放到候补]\n  F --&gt;|核销后发货前| I[取消订单 + 退款]\n  F --&gt;|发货后| J[人工复核]</pre><h3 id=\"三个约束的递减关系\">三个约束的递减关系</h3><p>先要把&quot;限购&quot;拆开。&quot;每人最多 2 件&quot;实际上混合了三个不同的约束，它们在实现上必须分开处理，否则会互相干扰。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>计数对象</th>\n<th>典型规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参与额度</td>\n<td>一个人能占多少份抽签运气</td>\n<td>抽签池中的报名/票号</td>\n<td>每人 1 次报名，多报不增加中签概率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中签额度</td>\n<td>一个人最多中几个名额</td>\n<td>中签/分配记录</td>\n<td>每人最多中 1 个尺码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>购买额度</td>\n<td>一个人最多买几件</td>\n<td>已核销的购买记录</td>\n<td>每账号 2 件，跨渠道合计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三者的关系是<strong>递减的</strong>：参与额度 ≥ 中签额度 ≥ 购买额度。把参与额度设成 1（每人一次报名）是最干净的做法，因为它让&quot;概率公平&quot;这句话有一个明确定义的对象。若允许重复报名提升概率，就必须解决&quot;重复计数&quot;的复杂合并问题，收益却很小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"统一配额账本\">统一配额账本</h2><h3 id=\"账本按自然人主体记账\">账本按自然人主体记账</h3><p>跨渠道限购的可行方案是引入一个<strong>中央配额账本</strong>：所有渠道的占用行为都必须在账本上申请额度，账本按自然人主体记账，而不是按渠道账号记账。</p>\n<p>账本的关键设计是<strong>主体归一化</strong>：渠道账号 → 自然人主体 ID 的映射由 <a href=\"multi-account-bot-dedup\">多账号/设备/机器人去重</a> 中的关联图产出。映射可能是多对一的（多个渠道账号指向同一主体），也可能是后置的（用户先在 App 报名，之后才在门店被识别出来）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE quota_ledger (&#10;  ledger_id    BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  subject_id   BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  channel      TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  channel_acct TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  qty          INT    NOT NULL CHECK (qty &gt; 0),&#10;  state        TEXT   NOT NULL CHECK (state IN (&#39;reserved&#39;,&#39;confirmed&#39;,&#39;released&#39;)),&#10;  acquired_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  expires_at   TIMESTAMPTZ&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 幂等：同一渠道账号对同一 SKU 的同一笔占用只记一次&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX quota_idem_uq&#10;  ON quota_ledger (channel, channel_acct, sku_id, acquired_at);&#10;&#10;-- 额度检查走这个索引：按主体 + SKU 汇总 confirmed/reserved&#10;CREATE INDEX quota_subject_sku_idx&#10;  ON quota_ledger (subject_id, sku_id)&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;reserved&#39;,&#39;confirmed&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_ledger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_acct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reserved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'released'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  acquired_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 幂等：同一渠道账号对同一 SKU 的同一笔占用只记一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_idem_uq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_ledger (channel, channel_acct, sku_id, acquired_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 额度检查走这个索引：按主体 + SKU 汇总 confirmed/reserved</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_subject_sku_idx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_ledger (subject_id, sku_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reserved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"空结果集不阻塞的并发陷阱\">空结果集不阻塞的并发陷阱</h3><p>额度检查是在<strong>一个事务内</strong>完成的，否则并发下单会同时通过检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;-- 锁定该主体在该 SKU 上的额度行，防止并发穿透&#10;SELECT COALESCE(SUM(qty), 0) AS used&#10;  FROM quota_ledger&#10; WHERE subject_id = $1 AND sku_id = $2&#10;   AND state IN (&#39;reserved&#39;,&#39;confirmed&#39;)&#10; FOR UPDATE;                      -- 无行时需配合 advisory lock&#10;&#10;-- used + $3 &lt;= limit 才允许&#10;INSERT INTO quota_ledger (subject_id, sku_id, channel, channel_acct, qty, state)&#10;VALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5, &#39;confirmed&#39;);&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 锁定该主体在该 SKU 上的额度行，防止并发穿透</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subject_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reserved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 无行时需配合 advisory lock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- used + $3 &#x3C;= limit 才允许</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_ledger (subject_id, sku_id, channel, channel_acct, qty, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面注释里的一个坑值得强调：<code>FOR UPDATE</code> 在<strong>没有任何行</strong>匹配时不会阻塞，因此当用户第一次购买（<code>used = 0</code>）时，两个并发请求会同时读到 0 并都插入成功。解决办法是改用 <code>pg_advisory_xact_lock(hashtext(subject_id || &#39;:&#39; || sku_id))</code> 先对主体+SKU 加一把事务级咨询锁——按 <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/functions-admin.html\">PostgreSQL 咨询锁文档</a>，<code>pg_advisory_xact_lock</code> &quot;获取一个排他的事务级咨询锁，必要时等待&quot;，且事务级锁&quot;在当前事务结束时自动释放，没有手动解锁操作&quot;，因此它不依赖行是否存在，也随事务结束自动释放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合并的时序问题\">合并的时序问题</h2><h3 id=\"合并后的处置随不可逆程度递减\">合并后的处置随不可逆程度递减</h3><p>跨渠道合并最麻烦的地方在于<strong>时序</strong>：用户在 App 报名时，系统还不知道他有门店账号；等他到门店时，App 已经中签了。合并必须能处理&quot;后到达的信息改变既有判定&quot;。</p>\n<p>处理原则是：<strong>合并使配额从宽，而不是从紧</strong>。具体地：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果在<strong>抽签前</strong>识别出两个渠道账号属于同一主体，把两份报名合并为一份（保留最早的那份，另一份标记为 <code>merged</code>），这会让该主体在抽签池中的占比下降，是公平的。</li>\n<li>如果在<strong>抽签后</strong>才发现同一主体有两个中签名额，<strong>不能</strong>简单地撤销其中一个并重新抽签——那会破坏&quot;抽签结果已公布不可变&quot;的承诺，也会让已中签者感到系统出尔反尔。正确做法是把多出的名额释放到候补队列（见 <a href=\"../raffle-entry-drawing/win-waitlist-abandon\">中签/候补/放弃处理</a>），并给被撤销者解释与补偿。</li>\n<li>如果合并是在<strong>支付完成之后</strong>才发生，涉及的是取消订单与退款，此时应走人工复核，因为自动撤销已经成交的订单会带来相当大的客诉成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发现时机</th>\n<th>已发生的事实</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抽签前</td>\n<td>只有报名</td>\n<td>合并为一份报名</td>\n<td>不影响任何已公布结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开奖后、核销前</td>\n<td>已中签未付款</td>\n<td>保留一份，其余释放到候补</td>\n<td>结果已公布，撤销成本可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核销后、发货前</td>\n<td>已付款未发货</td>\n<td>保留一份，其余订单取消退款</td>\n<td>需要通知与退款流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发货后</td>\n<td>已履约</td>\n<td>人工复核，标记主体</td>\n<td>自动处置成本过高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表体现了限购规则设计的一个重要原则：<strong>规则的严格程度应当随不可逆程度递减</strong>。越接近履约完成，自动化处置的收益越低、代价越高，此时正确的动作是把决定权交回给人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限购规则的形式化\">限购规则的形式化</h2><h3 id=\"把规则写成可复算的纯函数\">把规则写成可复算的纯函数</h3><p>为了让规则可测试、可在多渠道间一致执行，它应当被写成一段确定性的判定，而不是散落在各处的 if-else：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"quota_check(subject, sku, requested_qty):&#10;  used = SUM(qty) over ledger&#10;         WHERE subject_id = subject AND sku_id = sku&#10;           AND state IN (&#39;reserved&#39;,&#39;confirmed&#39;)&#10;  limit = resolve_limit(sku, subject.tier)     # 会员等级可提升额度&#10;  if used + requested_qty &gt; limit:&#10;      return DENY(reason=&#39;quota_exceeded&#39;,&#10;                  used=used, limit=limit)&#10;  if subject.risk_level in (&#39;LIMITED&#39;,&#39;BLOCKED&#39;):&#10;      return DENY(reason=&#39;risk_hold&#39;, appealable=true)&#10;  return ALLOW(reserve=requested_qty)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>quota_check(subject, sku, requested_qty):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  used = SUM(qty) over ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         WHERE subject_id = subject AND sku_id = sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           AND state IN ('reserved','confirmed')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  limit = resolve_limit(sku, subject.tier)     # 会员等级可提升额度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if used + requested_qty > limit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return DENY(reason='quota_exceeded',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  used=used, limit=limit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if subject.risk_level in ('LIMITED','BLOCKED'):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return DENY(reason='risk_hold', appealable=true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return ALLOW(reserve=requested_qty)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>resolve_limit</code> 应当是<strong>纯函数</strong>：给定 SKU 和主体等级返回一个整数。把它做成纯函数的价值在于可复算——审计时可以拿同一个函数对历史订单重算一遍，验证当时的判定是否一致（见 <a href=\"../scalper-fairness-guard/raffle-fairness-audit-trail\">抽签公平性审计与留痕</a>）。如果限额逻辑藏在多层条件分支里，这种复算就无法进行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么限购不该做得太紧\">为什么限购不该做得太紧</h2><p>有一个反直觉的经验：<strong>限购过紧会创造新的灰色市场</strong>。当限购被收紧到&quot;每人 1 件&quot;且核销成本很高时，黄牛的行为会从&quot;多账号多买&quot;转向&quot;多账号分批买 + 快速转手&quot;，同时普通用户为了帮家人买也会被迫使用亲属账号，反而制造出大量被系统判定为违规的真实用户。</p>\n<p>因此限购值的设定应当参考实际供给与需求的比。粗略的判据是：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（需求供给比）大于 50，限购收紧到 1 的边际收益很高（因为中签率本身就低，多买的空间不大）；若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 在 3–10 之间，限购设为 2–3 反而更合理，因为它减少了账号共享的动机。这个判据的量化基础在 <a href=\"../raffle-experience-ops/limited-release-demand-gauge\">限量发售热度与需求度量</a> 中给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>限购包含三个正交维度：参与额度、中签额度、购买额度，三者递减，必须分开实现。</li>\n<li>跨渠道限购靠<strong>中央配额账本</strong>落地，账本按自然人主体记账；主体归一来自身份关联图。</li>\n<li>并发下的额度检查要注意 <code>FOR UPDATE</code> 对<strong>空结果集不阻塞</strong>的陷阱，用 <code>pg_advisory_xact_lock</code> 对主体+SKU 加事务级锁更稳。</li>\n<li>合并的处置强度必须随<strong>不可逆程度</strong>递减：抽签前合并、开奖后释放到候补、成交后走退款、发货后人工复核。</li>\n<li>限购规则应写成含纯函数 <code>resolve_limit</code> 的确定性判定，以便审计复算；过紧的限购会催生账号共享，反而误伤真实用户。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"每人限购规则与合并","id":"每人限购规则与合并"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"限购的三个正交维度","id":"限购的三个正交维度"},{"level":3,"text":"三个约束是递减的","id":"三个约束是递减的"},{"level":3,"text":"跨渠道额度申请与合并流程","id":"跨渠道额度申请与合并流程"},{"level":3,"text":"三个约束的递减关系","id":"三个约束的递减关系"},{"level":2,"text":"统一配额账本","id":"统一配额账本"},{"level":3,"text":"账本按自然人主体记账","id":"账本按自然人主体记账"},{"level":3,"text":"空结果集不阻塞的并发陷阱","id":"空结果集不阻塞的并发陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"合并的时序问题","id":"合并的时序问题"},{"level":3,"text":"合并后的处置随不可逆程度递减","id":"合并后的处置随不可逆程度递减"},{"level":2,"text":"限购规则的形式化","id":"限购规则的形式化"},{"level":3,"text":"把规则写成可复算的纯函数","id":"把规则写成可复算的纯函数"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么限购不该做得太紧","id":"为什么限购不该做得太紧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多账号/设备/机器人去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/identity-limit-binding/multi-account-bot-dedup"},"next":{"title":"批量抢购/黄牛识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/scalper-fairness-guard/scalper-bulk-acquire-detect"}}